{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Word Play is a brain-busting spelling game about making words, getting upgrades, and scoring big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/spell.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to spell the biggest and best words you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop letters, click on tiles, or simply type with the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/shop.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score enough points to clear the round and pick an upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modifiers change the fundamental rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades let you modify your tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gifts add new tiles to your letter bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/upgrade.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade tiles to special forms like Golden, Diamond, Emerald, and Potion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or use upgrades to destroy, discard, or duplicate tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/bigscorefixed.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine long words, special tiles, and modified rules to score big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/specialround.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every word you spell uses a &quot;play&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you reach the end without running out of plays?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for tricky special rounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal, Hard, Ruthless, and Legendary Difficulty Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time Attack mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accessibility features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Description, screenshots, videos and GIFs represent a game that is still in development. Features and visuals are subject to change before launch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586660?t=1745470430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/1ab2083668a919234eb53de6032d1cb0ae148d57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745470430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/4ca5d4300efede46e5f3b65416d94706a71867f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745470430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/4ca5d4300efede46e5f3b65416d94706a71867f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745470430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Word Play is a brain-busting spelling game about making words, getting upgrades, and scoring big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586660/extras/spell.gif?t=1745470430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to spell the biggest and best words you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop letters, click on tiles, or simply